#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

The KCP is torn between many different ideological currents. What should be our primary ideological guidance for now?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @socialist_struggle: The party must choose a left wing path , slowly but surely educating the populace and workers in order to pave a way to a socialist republic.
- @humanist: The KCP is the founding party of the republic it is our job to educate the people in democracy and remain their steadfast protectors.
- @liberal: We are the party of freedom and we must represent that.
- @constitutionalist: Following Annastasia we must maintain the current status quo while improving the national situation. Our loyalties lie to the country not to any ideaology.
- @neoforsvollrist: The Neo-Forsvollrist are a fringe wing mostly surrounding our Guran electorate. They support strong and technocratic governance and corporatist economy.
- @easy_discard

@socialist_struggle
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "socialist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "socialist"; socialist_strength += 10; socialist_dissent -= 5; up_relation += 3; vnpf_relation -= 5; nationalization_support += 1; up_relation += 3

The left of the party has somehow managed to sway the rest for slow progress towards socialism. It is possible the other wings are only using it.

@humanist
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "humanist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "humanist"; humanist_strength += 10; humanist_dissent -= 10; socialist_dissent -= 5; liberal_dissent -= 5; nationalization_support += 1

The humanists in the middle of the party have proposed a set of points all wings can compromise upon , the expansion of our democracy and the education of the populace in the ways of its workings. Even if some wings only do so for their own goals.

@liberal
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "liberal") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "liberal"; liberal_strength += 10; liberal_dissent -= 5; up_relation -= 3; socialist_dissent += 5; neoforsvollrist_dissent += 5; nationalization_support += 1

The liberals of all colours in our party sway us by their ideas about personal and economic freedoms. Neoforsvollrists and Socialists grumble.

@constitutionalist
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "constitutionalist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "constitutionalist"; constitutionalist_strength += 10; democratization += 1; constitutionalist_dissent -= 5; vnpf_relation += 5; up_relation += 5; hp_relation -= 8

The constitutionalist wing manages to push through their three pillars idea. Unity , Sovereignty , Democracy. The status-quo continues.

@neoforsvollrist
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "neoforsvollrist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "neoforsvollrist"; neoforsvollrist_strength += 10; democratization -= 1; constitutionalist_dissent -= 5; vnpf_relation -= 5; up_relation -= 5;  wtb_support += 1; humanist_dissent += 10; socialist_dissent += 5; liberal_dissent += 5

The Neoforsvollrists with the support the support of our Guran branch have pushed through their ideaology. This will alienate the left and center wings.

@changed
on-arrival: socialist_dissent += 5; humanist_dissent += 5; liberal_dissent += 5; constitutionalist_dissent += 5; neoforsvollrist_dissent += 5

We have changed ideologies. Many in the party feel unmoored.
